    "setup_instructions": {
      "value": "    \n✅ Aurora Serverless v2 cluster deployed successfully!\n    \nDatabase Details:\n- Cluster: advisor-aurora-cluster\n- Database: advisor\n- Data API: Enabled\n    \nAdd the following to your .env file:\nAURORA_CLUSTER_ARN=arn:aws:rds:ca-central-1:502424146170:cluster:advisor-aurora-cluster\nAURORA_SECRET_ARN=arn:aws:secretsmanager:ca-central-1:502424146170:secret:advisor-aurora-credentials-415844fc-GrByYS\n    \nTest the Data API connection:\naws rds-data execute-statement \\\n  --resource-arn arn:aws:rds:ca-central-1:502424146170:cluster:advisor-aurora-cluster \\\n  --secret-arn arn:aws:secretsmanager:ca-central-1:502424146170:secret:advisor-aurora-credentials-415844fc-GrByYS \\\n  --database advisor \\\n  --sql \"SELECT version()\"\n    \nTo set up the database schema:\ncd backend/database\nuv run migrate.py\n    \nTo load sample data:\nuv run reset_db.py --with-test-data\n    \n💰 Cost Management:\n- Current scaling: 0.5 - 1 ACUs\n- Estimated cost: ~$43/month minimum\n- To pause: Set min_capacity to 0 (cluster will pause after 5 minutes of inactivity)\n",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
